#. module: mrp_production_classification
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mrp_production_classification.view_mrp_classification_wizard_form
msgid ""
"The total distributed differs from the initially planned quantity.\n"
"                    This is just a warning; the actual consumption of the original product\n"
"                    will always equal the total distributed. Check the confirmation box to continue."
msgstr ""
"El total repartido difiere de la cantidad inicialmente planificada.\n"
"                    Esto es solo un aviso; el consumo real del producto original\n"
"                    siempre será igual al total repartido. Marque la casilla de confirmación para continuar."

#. module: mrp_production_classification
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mrp_production_classification/wizard/mrp_classification_wizard.py:0
